hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"179","[AI-translation] Ewe Allah! Nakuomba kheri yake na najikinga Kwako na shari yake. [Husomwa upepo ukivuma]"
"180","[AI-translation] Ewe Allah! Nakuomba kheri yake, kheri ya kilichomo, na kheri ya alichotumwa nacho; na najikinga Kwako na shari yake, shari ya kilichomo, na shari ya alichotumwa nacho. [Husomwa upepo ukivuma]"
